sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as You
  participant M as mojrepos
  participant G as GitHub (read-only)
  participant K as knowcat
  participant H as Knowledge hub

  U->>M: Ask about repositories
  M->>M: Detect knowcat and check contract version
  M->>U: Confirm hub and scope (if not already approved)
  M->>G: Read listing, metadata, root READMEs
  G-->>M: Evidence
  M->>K: Writer-only evidence packet
  K->>H: Check approval and containment, then write
  K-->>M: Saved paths and validation result
  M-->>U: Answer with citations, coverage and what was saved
